          "Thus $t=\\ln3/\\ln2\\approx1.585$.",
          "The culture reaches {{target}} cells after about 1.585 hours."
        ],
        "answerSummary": "$t=\\frac{\\ln3}{\\ln2}\\approx1.585$ hours"
